#: ../../../fuel_contributing_world.md:1
msgid "Contributing a New World"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_contributing_world.md:3
msgid ""
"A world consists of a description of global properties and a set of models "
"that populate the environment. The description format is [SDF](http://"
"sdformat.org/), and you can find example worlds at [https://app.gazebosim."
"org/fuel/worlds](https://app.gazebosim.org/fuel/worlds). Worlds can be used "
"by simulators to launch and simulate models in a specific environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_contributing_world.md:7
msgid ""
"You can upload a new world to Gazebo by completing the form on [https://app."
"gazebosim.org/fuel/worlds/upload](https://app.gazebosim.org/fuel/worlds/"
"upload). The upload form allows you to specify a name for the world, along "
"with a description and tag data."
msgstr ""
